      "name": "Frozen Heirloom Tomatoes",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">This is an assorted mix of frozen heirloom variety tomatoes - heirloom slicer, paste, and beefsteak tomatoes.  They are whole but have been cored.  </span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Frozen tomatoes are ideal for cooking in sauces, soups, and stews because their texture becomes soft and watery after thawing.  To thaw, place them in a bowl or sink, run them under warm water, or use them frozen in a slow-cooking recipe.</span></p>",
